# shell: tracker
# IV-023: a pose cut to the clipboard is drawn faded, and an aborted cut
# returns it to full strength.
wait 8
expect-pixel 20 123 222015
click-row 1
wait 2
key x ctrl
wait 3
expect-pixel 20 123 9b9a95
note Escape aborts the cut; the art returns at full strength, in the
note selected paint the still-standing selection asks for
key Escape
wait 3
expect-pixel 20 123 273842
quit
